                </div>

                <div class="w-full shrink-0 md:w-auto px-2 md:px-0 flex flex-col gap-4">
                    <h3 class="text-[#2e4394] text-md font-bold text-center  flex items-center justify-center">พรรคเพื่อไทย</h3>
